no interest in learning any new writing system) (and I already knew about
the Savian alphabet, FWIW), you can't use "la ca." for a name.  "la" must b=
e
followed by a cmevla (a word ending in a consonant) or a valid selbri.  "ca=
"
is neither.  I suggest "cav" (since they already adjectivify it to "Shavian=
"
in English).

